{"server":"cn","storyId":"act23side_level_act23side_01_end","groupId":"act23side","stageId":"act23side_01","title":"塞上春来","storyCode":"WB-1","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_01_end.txt","sourceHash":"6ec5a0e1c2ba793d0aecbd10e5bb63393ab96ff15757d1f286f91eadc4f89b37","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"一波又起，一个神秘少女盗走了重岳封印了岁兽意识的剑。左宣辽下令展开追捕巨兽信徒的一系列行动。林雨霞遇到了槐琥与杜遥夜，三人决定要联手追凶。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异族装扮的少女","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可知你现在身在何处，手里拿着的那把剑又是何物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异族装扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一把剑，我要找的剑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我先不问你是受何人指使，又为何能出现在此处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把剑交出来，跟我去见宗师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异族装扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薄情寡义，背信弃义之人，不配拥有这把剑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放肆！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗师守护玉门安危百年，岂容你信口玷污？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异族装扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"装模作样，你又知道些什么？让开！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"逮捕过的不法之徒不少，像阁下这样嚣张的，我还是头一回见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异族装扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"表面道貌岸然，其实自私自利。你们这样的人，我见多了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我只好用强硬手段请阁下伏法了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异族装扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你出刀，试试看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"胜负已分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的胜负，不是在这里分出的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人和说法，阁下总得留下一个。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想要一些答案。但你给不了我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是让她逃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"受了那么重的伤，总该跑不远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"魏老二，你这把老骨头也是不顶用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"有劳林先生搭救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"堂堂赤霄剑主人，被仇家找上门来，也要靠他人搭救了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我可真不记得，我还有这么一号仇家——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"声东击西！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_n"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异族装扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你受伤了。还能往哪里逃？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异族装扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗师小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗师，这里又发生了什么事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我疏忽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剑，被盗走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g7_zuosroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"禀将军，内城楼方圆五里内没有找到刺客下落，也没有发现有其他贼寇接应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有其他人受到袭击，核心内城、军武库也没有被闯入的痕迹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是没有“痕迹”，还是确认没有被闯入？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"暂时，无法确认......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这世上竟还有人能随意出入玉门军营，连你们四位高手都留不下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是咄咄怪事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪我大意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏公对于刺客身份，可有些眉目？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"这么多年来，想要这条命的人，很多，但魏彦吾还好好地活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"他们要么放下了念头，要么已经变成了一抔黄土。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚这位朋友，我的确不认识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左乐，你那边有什么发现？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事发突然，我准备不及，没能捉拿刺客......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有问你为何没能捉住刺客，我问你看到了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"潜入盗剑的刺客，是个年轻女性，逃走时身上负了伤。除此之外......没有更多的线索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"酒杯碎裂，残片尽数被平祟侯攥在手心。\n贵宾在座，但他那一瞬还是没能收住怒意，就像日间没能控制住自己引弓时颤抖的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事已至此，多说无益。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"传我命令。立即封锁城门，各城区之间加设哨卡，禁止一切不必要的人员流动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，通报全城，玉门城两日后申时起，减速以调整航线，请百姓有所准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左乐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓捕刺客，追回宗师佩剑，找出潜藏在城内的山海众，三件事全须做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给你三日时间，我的亲兵交由你调遣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不得走漏消息，不得惊扰百姓安生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林先生呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"守军就位后他就已经离开了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"林毕竟不算朝堂中人，就不便领平祟侯将令了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不知还有什么事是我能帮上忙的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今夜刺客显然是冲魏公而来，魏公还是应当以自身安全为重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到事情平息，我再另外派遣军队护送魏公返回龙门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这几天，魏公还是不要四处走动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道这“不要走动”的意思是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是不要走动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剩下的事情，玉门自己解决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"......当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次敌人来头不小，不如还是由我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是有劳宗师留在军营，保护太傅和魏公安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是放任贼寇在城中流窜，同样危险。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这件事是由巨兽而起，以宗师身份，不方便出手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟应该知道宗师真正身份的人，也就只有这间屋子里的各位了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"将军的话音不重，却让整间屋子安静了下来。\n不知哪个角落传来一声叹气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......也罢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"末将这样安排，太傅可有异议？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信平祟侯的判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以上安排，即刻执行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g11_yanroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师，您没事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打死我也不相信，这世上还有能伤到他的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还真是信任我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，你们都已经听说了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城外领兵暂且不论。城内的治安布防，本来就是你的职责范围。左宣辽这样安排，摆明了不信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左将军的意思，我当然明白，也能体谅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以这几天，有些事还得拜托你替我走动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次事态非常，敌人也格外棘手，左乐那边，你最好能多帮帮他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按他的个性，也未必就愿意让我插手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我们之间的事，也不适宜在这时候解决了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用多说，我心里有数。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这几天无事可做，那《武典》最后的几章，辛苦你陪我尽快撰写。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是学生应该做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师没有别的吩咐，学生就告辞了。老师也早些休息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"也不知道是看见了墙壁上空着的剑架，还是别的什么，男人一声叹息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这局棋，你到底还要卷入多少人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一瓢清水倒入浊江，便再也不能从江中舀出一瓢同样的清水。这样的道理你难道不明白吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你取而代之，也绝无可能在一片混沌中再见她一面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你做这一切，又是何苦......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"远处巡逻队伍行进时的甲胄碰撞声依稀可闻，除此外便再无别的声响。\n夜色苍茫，这个喧嚣的夜晚终于安静了下来。\n又是一声长长的叹息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g2_yumenstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"narration","text":"你很有勇气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我居然没有发现，你也在这里......"},{"type":"narration","text":"我当然也在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你难道要阻止我？"},{"type":"narration","text":"善弈者通局无妙手，你的行为，未免太激进了点。\n哦......或许是因为，你已时日无多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要说时日无多，你应该也没有什么余裕。"},{"type":"narration","text":"你当真以为，那人将“自己”封印入剑，就可以等闲视之？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是为了“一”而来，岂会担心那十二分之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我反而想问，你又凭什么觉得，你可以成为他？"},{"type":"narration","text":"我不会成为他。我始终是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我与他的事，需要做一个了结。"},{"type":"narration","text":"那是你们的恩怨。\n我们并非敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不完全由你说了算。"},{"type":"narration","text":"至少当下，我们各自应该都有更重要的事要做。\n我们不会是彼此的妨碍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是在向我求和？"},{"type":"narration","text":"两分之势，你没有理由拒绝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你果然和你的“兄弟姐妹”很不一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望下次再见的时候，你能让我看到一些有趣的东西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙门游客？","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐！听说您今天——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别声张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是说过了不要这么光明正大地见我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙门游客？","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"您没事就好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们那边有什么进展没有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙门游客？","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"玉门集市几年一开，货流量和人流量都很大，人多眼杂，暂时还没有头绪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不好查，就请人帮我们查。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙门游客？","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"大小姐的意思是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玉门集市的这些商贩，有多少是本地人，又有多少是从龙门过来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后面这批人里，有多少在近卫局那边手续并不齐全，是受了咱们照顾的？筛一遍，找个比我们方便行事的，不难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙门游客？","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"大小姐，这......似乎不太合规矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按我说的做。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_o"},{"type":"narration","text":"半月前"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨兽信徒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"情报的来源，你没必要细问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"炎国千百年来对付过的敌人，从来不只在明处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然玉门常年依靠龙门补给，但城中治安应该不是您职责之内的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"玉门是一面坚不可破的盾，但是盾牌背面潜藏的蛀虫，需要另外有人来帮它驱除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我想派你去解决这件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以让你以龙门近卫局特别指挥使的身份行动，名义上的工作是负责两城对接期间的治安问题。我也会给你一定的支援。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"彻查潜藏在玉门民间的危险分子，确保玉门平安归航。如有必要，也可以采用极端手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么是我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你是林雨霞，你可以做到这件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魏彦吾","speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","isRemote":false,"text":"当年鼠王在龙门做过的事，我需要你在玉门再做一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏长官......您在找到我之前，并没有和我爸谈过，对吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"雨霞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸？您没说过会来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你领了魏彦吾的任务，我总得跟过来看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您都知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"“搜查走私犯”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不想让您为难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"还要你费尽心思地瞒着我，为难的应该是魏彦吾才对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你就没有想过拒绝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除暴安良，安抚百姓的事，总得有人来做......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彦吾手下能办这件事的人物有的是，他就一定要你来蹚这浑水？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，我就是用尾巴尖都能想到，魏老二用的是哪一套说辞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚发生的事，也得让你知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才守军封锁了城门，原来就是为了这件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从白天到晚上，这连续发生的事情，如果说是巧合，那未免也太巧合了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门总督遇刺，宗师佩剑被盗，钦天监信使被杀，无论哪件，单拎出来都是惊天动地的大事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"现在居然同时发生，背后牵动的势力，难以想象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"魏彦吾找到你的时候，有没有跟你讲过这件事有多危险？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只知道这件事非同小可。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"玉门不是龙门，你也不是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我心里有数......我会谨慎处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次从龙门带过来的暗桩，都是跟着您有些年头的好手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"江湖上的事，我也有经验......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是有主意，那就不用我唠叨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"但愿这次能早些了事，不耽误你去维多利亚的行程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一次游学罢了，不去也没什么的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"这些年你帮我，帮近卫局料理了不少事，都没能去做些自己真正想做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这都是我自己选的，我做的事也都是为了龙门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"没见过另一条路，就不能算自己的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"有时想想，像陈那样，又何尝不——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸！你受伤了？！我去找医生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"好久没有活动过手脚，筋骨紧了。看来每天只是在公园散步，运动量还是不够。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我送你回将军府。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"也不用，我今晚就在这边客栈歇息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"老朋友打过一次招呼也就够了。左军侯府上今晚的氛围，我可受不了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这可真是巧了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"晚上听到城边有动静，正想是出了什么大事，现在见到林先生才能确信，出的事肯定小不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"鲤先生的意思是，我这只老鼠跟瘟神没有区别了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"岂敢岂敢，玩笑玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"雨霞，我和鲤先生说几句话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我先告辞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"看样子，你在玉门找人，也不太顺利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别提了。一个消失了十几年的人，我也没指望能在一个月里找到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但不管花多少时间，总还是要找的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"鲤先生向来是位自在人，只有在这位老朋友的事上，才会这么操劳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许是我上辈子欠他的吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你不急在这一时，那我能不能委托鲤氏侦探事务所帮个忙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林先生开了口，我哪有拒绝的道理......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过话说回来，最近我接的麻烦事是不是太多了点？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"能者多劳，这件事算我姓林的欠你一笔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林先生这么客气，我还真得掂量掂量这件事办不办得成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，这件事，就得你这个人精来做。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g2_yumenstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一、二......九、十......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"排行榜上前面这些人，各个都不是好对付的啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平常心，平常心。尽力而为......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么不能出城？我两个兄弟就这么死在城外......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城门已封闭，姑娘请回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你们还讲不讲道理——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g6_yumengate"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇，使金瓜的丰蹄汉子直接被踹飞出擂台了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门路人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"算下来，那个菲林女孩已经连赢了五场！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你好，认识一下，今天你的比赛我全都看了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么厉害的功夫，要不要考虑加入我的镖局？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"镖局？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我拒绝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别拒绝这么快啊，凭你的身手，我可以给你开一份说得过去的工资！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有打算靠拳脚吃饭，我可是正经机械工程专业的大学毕业生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"机械什么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了！反正你是说自己是理科生对吧？理科生好啊，我说的镖局，是新型物流公司，理科生正好大有作为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎你别走啊，我说真的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g2_yumenstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来还发生了这样的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那几位朋友的遗物和讣告，也只能等到戒严结束后才能送回尚蜀了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我带他们出来的，不管用什么方式，我都会带他们回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来玉门之前，我在尚蜀碰巧见过郑前辈一面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"郑前辈告诉过我，等到人人都不需要习武来保护自己的那一天，才算是真正的太平日子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹说的这些道理都对，但现在，我更喜欢另外一句江湖老话，血债血偿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一定会把凶手找出来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们怎么在这儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雨霞姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是白天那个官差大小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是说会查清楚吗？戒了严还怎么查清楚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们俩也见过？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有了新的变故，事情比想象的还要棘手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就让我和你一起去查！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，也可以帮忙的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这件事的危险程度，不应该让旁人——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是，什么声音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是外城军防区传来的鼓声？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看，城头点起烽火了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玉门的传统，望烽节，这是每年开春的时候，都要举行的仪式，连续三天。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"军营的鼓，是敲给城内的将士百姓听的，征鼓声声，告诉人们城池无恙，山河无恙，大炎无恙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城头的烽燧，则是为牺牲在沙场的英灵指一条回家的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杜遥夜","speakerId":"avg_npc_296_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回家......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"天灾过境、外虏叩边、流寇滋事......\n整整十七声军鼓，象征着过去一年里玉门经历过的大小劫难。\n这座曾横于北方数百年的塞上城市，因劫难而厚重。这座城市里的人，因铭记劫难而骨气铮铮。\n长风不灭原上火，一夜征人尽望乡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_2005_weiyw","aliases":["魏彦吾"]}]}
